{"seq":36,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w00799"},"reason":"The wording said the 80th Academy Awards were in doubt 'until a few days before the date', but the Writers Guild strike ended on 12 February 2008, twelve days before the 24 February ceremony (as the article body already says). The question now says 'until less than two weeks before the date' in all three languages; the answer is unchanged.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007%E2%80%932008_Writers_Guild_of_America_strike"},{"url":"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/news/oscar-has-experience-strike-related-104329"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Why was the 80th Academy Awards ceremony in 2008 in doubt until a few days before the date?","new":"Why was the 80th Academy Awards ceremony in 2008 in doubt until less than two weeks before the date?"},{"field":"de","old":"Warum stand die 80. Oscarverleihung 2008 bis wenige Tage vor dem Termin auf der Kippe?","new":"Warum stand die 80. Oscarverleihung 2008 bis knapp zwei Wochen vor dem Termin auf der Kippe?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Почему 80-я церемония вручения «Оскара» в 2008 году оставалась под вопросом почти до самой даты?","new":"Почему 80-я церемония вручения «Оскара» в 2008 году оставалась под вопросом, пока до неё не осталось меньше двух недель?"}],"hash":"f113426d3b18","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"b9407e0ef18f808cc51ba0c5962ba8c837eccdcf58a50a5be25a95643302f818"},
